DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42518::$$$message_0339_0000_0000$$$::"Goodness, what a farce."::
42519::$$$message_0339_0000_0001$$$::"You said it. Kotomine was even gloating when he saw how annoyed Lancer looked."::
42520::$$$message_0339_0000_0002$$$::"He's happy as long as someone else isn't."::
42521::$$$message_0339_0000_0003$$$::"A real character, I'll give him that."::
42522::$$$message_0339_0000_0004$$$::"Hm. But Rin, why would you suggest that both of us enter the bath at this point?"::
42523::$$$message_0339_0000_0005$$$::"S-so what if I did? I want to be lucky, and I want to do something about your painfully low Luck stat."::
42524::$$$message_0339_0000_0006$$$::"If the bath only has one use left, then it's the only choice we have."::
42525::$$$message_0339_0000_0007$$$::"...I see.[lr]::
42526::$$$message_0339_0000_0008$$$::Well, as long as you're fine with it."::
42527::$$$message_0339_0000_0009$$$::"Besides, you could've just entered the bath in spirit form."::
42528::$$$message_0339_0000_0010$$$::"...Is that how you see us Servants?"::
42529::$$$message_0339_0000_0011$$$::"Not at all. No matter how twisted your path was, you're still a genuine hero. I trust you wouldn't do something like that."::
42530::$$$message_0339_0000_0012$$$::"That's a rather pointed way of putting it."::
42531::$$$message_0339_0000_0013$$$::"You sure you're not just projecting?"::
42532::$$$message_0339_0000_0014$$$::"...Just so you know, I wouldn't do that."::
42533::$$$message_0339_0000_0015$$$::"I know. Because if you did, I'd use my Command Spells to kick your butt."::
42534::$$$message_0339_0000_0016$$$::"...My, what an uncouth atmosphere for a bathhouse."::
42535::$$$message_0339_0001_0000$$$::"Of course, it would be a mistake to expect any sensual appeal from you."::
42536::$$$message_0339_0001_0001$$$::"Hmph! Not taking the bait."::
42537::$$$message_0339_0001_0002$$$::"Haha. Oh look, Rin. The cherry blossoms are falling."::
42538::$$$message_0339_0001_0003$$$::"They are... It's so pretty."::
42539::$$$message_0339_0001_0004$$$::"...They are. It's not a bad backdrop to relax with. Makes the hot bath all that much more soothing."::
42540::$$$message_0339_0001_0005$$$::"Yeah. I'll let your insult slide out of respect for the cherry blossoms."::
42541::$$$message_0339_0001_0006$$$::"I feel lucky to hear that... We may as well take our time and enjoy this while we can.":9Œ